# Trusted click-through allowlist for Hyprland's overlay patch.
# Install as /etc/hypr/clickthrough.conf (root-owned; editing needs sudo).
#
# One ECMAScript regex per line, matched case-insensitively against the
# window WM_CLASS. A window matching a rule gets wl_surface / X11 input
# shape hit-testing: clicks on transparent pixels fall through to whatever
# is behind it.

# Steam overlay-style "Hero Town" games (Wine/DXVK layered overlays)
steam_app_.*

# Example: allow an Electron overlay by class
# my-overlay-app